OL,3,AUproar over missing 'pop' as Rice
OL,4,AKrispies changes its recipe
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cereal giant said the new versions
OL,7,Fhad been "carefully assessed for taste,
OL,8,Fappearance and texture", but fans
OL,9,Fcomplained online they no longer made
OL,10,Fthe famous "pop" sound and said their
OL,11,Fchildren would no longer eat them.
